      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدُّ</span></b>  (S, M, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِدُّ</span></b>  (T, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آدُّ</span></b>  (K)
<i>Strength; power; force:</i> (S, M, K:) <i>superior
power or force or influence; mastery; conquest;
predominance.</i> (M, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِدُّ</span>, in
two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, the first, The <i>sound of treading.</i> (T.)

